{
  "name": "Demo 1 — Trigger (業務回報新商機)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "ef41afb2-e103-429c-9fde-93d09d355e1c",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8a6eb022-d89d-40f3-9497-12797eca7e16",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        200,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "new-deal",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "id": "bc60cc7c-f5d3-4516-b873-39c43635872c",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        780
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "dealId",
              "value": "=DEAL-{{ $now.toFormat(\"yyyyMMddHHmmss\") }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "name": "salesRep",
              "value": "={{ $json.body ? $json.body.salesRep : ($json.salesRep ?? \"林志明\") }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "name": "customer",
              "value": "={{ $json.body ? $json.body.customer : ($json.customer ?? \"鴻海精密工業\") }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "name": "amount",
              "value": "={{ $json.body ? $json.body.amount : ($json.amount ?? 640000) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "name": "stage",
              "value": "提案中",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "7b8e30f8-5ea3-4262-b2a6-c84e1fee5d6f",
      "name": "Format Deal Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"success\": true, \"dealId\": \"{{ $json.dealId }}\", \"message\": \"商機已建立！\" }"
      },
      "id": "6b0da702-a490-4287-8630-e92a9c410b41",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        780,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demo 1：Trigger 觸發節點\n### 比喻：業務回報新商機\n\n**核心概念：** 每個 Workflow 至少需要一個 Trigger 來啟動\n\n**三種觸發方式：**\n- **Manual** → 手動按鈕測試（開發除錯用）\n- **Schedule** → 定時自動執行（每小時抓取 CRM 新商機）\n- **Webhook** → 外部系統呼叫（CRM / 表單送入）\n\n**教學重點：** 三個 Trigger 都連到同一個節點 (fan-in 模式)",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "500b10c0-313b-4f89-8c3d-09e702116f48",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Manual Trigger\n按一下就跑，開發測試最方便\n\n→ 搭配 pinData 預設銷售資料\n不需要真的呼叫 CRM",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "da03ac53-9f69-4ae0-baac-199e7ed5cb36",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Schedule Trigger\n時間到自動觸發\n\n每小時 = 定時巡檢 CRM 新商機\n像是同步資料、排程報表",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "88bee6ca-d865-40ac-8e58-fe5fddafe1ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Webhook Trigger\n外部系統 POST 進來觸發\n\nCRM 填完表單自動送入\npath: /webhook/new-deal",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "10484efd-2b31-4759-90ef-aa261055e64c",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        660
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 共用處理區\n三種觸發 → 同一個 Format 節點\n\n**Fan-in 模式：**\n多條入口，一個出口\n\n→ Respond to Webhook 只在\nWebhook 觸發時才會執行",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "4a1fb191-1d66-4156-bc62-0d65936ba339",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        340
      ]
    }
  ],
